---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | One Take Wonder Marketing"
  description="Terms of service for One Take Wonder Marketing. Outlining the terms and conditions for our marketing services."
  canonical="terms"
>
  <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-gray">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-10">Last updated: June 2026</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">1. Services</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        One Take Wonder Marketing provides marketing strategy, creative services, media buying, digital marketing, web design, and related consulting services. All services are delivered according to the scope and terms outlined in each client's individual service agreement.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">2. Client Responsibilities</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Clients agree to provide timely access to necessary materials, brand assets, and approvals to enable service delivery. Delays in providing materials or feedback may impact project timelines.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Upon full payment, clients own the final deliverables created specifically for their project. One Take Wonder Marketing retains the right to display completed work in our portfolio unless otherwise agreed in writing.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">4. Payment Terms</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Payment terms are specified in each client's service agreement. Standard terms are net-15 for invoiced services. Late payments may result in paused campaigns or services.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        One Take Wonder Marketing is not liable for indirect or consequential damages arising from the use of our services. Our liability is limited to the fees paid for the specific services in question.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">6. Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        For questions about these terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@onetakewondermarketing.com" class="text-brand-pink hover:underline">hello@onetakewondermarketing.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
